  "claim_ceiling": "Synthetic provider declarations only. Schema validity is structural. Owner refs, signatures, signer authority, capability qualification, expiry/dispute/supersession derivation, calendar availability, reservation, execution and accepted output require independent owner-specific resolution. A structurally valid offer can never self-assert Qualified, Available, Bookable, Reserved, Executed or Accepted."
